Annual leave — Nitra plant (HR-AL-NR)

Issuer: Moser Slovakia s. r. o., závod Nitra · IČO 47 556 210 · Priemyselná 4, 949 01 Nitra  

Effective: 1 January 2024 · Owner: Plant HR, Nitra

The plant collective agreement has not been reopened. Shift employees at Nitra accrue 20 days of annual leave per calendar year, plus compensatory rest for night and weekend shifts under §97 of the Labour Code.

A leave request longer than 5 consecutive working days needs the shift leader's approval 14 days in advance. Unused days above 5 do not cash out except on termination.

Collision
Bratislava office staff are on 25 days. Never quote 20 days to an office colleague, and never quote 25 days to someone on the Nitra plant payroll.

